<main class="gh-main gh-outer">
    <div class="gh-inner gh-container">
        <div class="gh-container-inner">
            <div class="gh-main">
                <article class="gh-content home-content skychopath-home">
                    {{#page}}
                        <h1 class="is-title skychopath-home-title">{{title}}</h1>
                        {{content}}
                    {{else}}
                        <h1 class="is-title skychopath-home-title">{{@site.title}}</h1>
                        <p>首頁內容暫時無法顯示，請稍後再試，或使用上方導覽瀏覽其他頁面。</p>
                    {{/page}}
                </article>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</main>
